WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
By the way, do you have a car at school?

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,680
No cars are at home

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,840
As soon as the tour bus rings, I lose my authority and come up

4
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:08,520
The tram is quiet, has a short range and is difficult to charge.

5
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:10,640
I want a machine that is quiet and can run far

6
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,040
Extended range electric vehicle

7
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,840
You can run short distances with a small battery, but you can run long distances with a mailbox to generate electricity.

8
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,680
Can't fire the engine, just right

9
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:19,480
Trigger the task to obtain an extended-range electric vehicle

10
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:23,040
No limit to the method. Reward the car version with unlimited magic machines. Choose once.

11
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:25,840
The rewards for the car version are interesting

12
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:31,990
Get this car before leaving school.

13
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:34,550
Suhao, the door to the medical building is poisoned.

14
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,550
There must be someone alive inside

15
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:39,150
Poisoned to death is different from the art building door opening.

16
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,510
There are people here and they dare to take action

17
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:44,900
Xu Qing might be inside

18
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,260
You work from the outside

19
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:50,140
Wait for me to open the way out. The first thing is to go into the building and find Xu Qing’en.
